split:['You want predictions on a new machine. Which evaluation is stronger for that question?',['Randomly mix each machine’s rows','Hold out whole machines'],1,'Match the evaluation boundary to transfer across machines.'],
timeline:['You removed nighttime rows. Does shifting 96 remaining rows necessarily mean 24 hours?',['Yes','No: align by timestamps'],1,'Filtering makes row positions an unreliable clock.'],
context:['Which operation updates model weights?',['Add examples to a prompt','Retrieve a manual','Fine-tune with training examples'],2,'Prompting and retrieval supply inference context; fine-tuning updates parameters.'],
